2092
02:14:45.354 --> 02:14:48.914
cannabis is too often mistaken for the cause of an

2093
02:14:49.074 --> 02:14:52.814
overdose simply because it is detected.

2094
02:14:52.894 --> 02:14:56.334
In clinical practice, that is rarely how medicine works.

2095
02:14:57.034 --> 02:15:00.654
We are not here to suggest cannabis carries no risk, but

2096
02:15:00.694 --> 02:15:04.174
because detection is not the same as causation,

2097
02:15:04.734 --> 02:15:08.494
