2107
02:15:39.454 --> 02:15:43.114
When someone arrives critically unwell, we doctors don't

2108
02:15:43.234 --> 02:15:46.714
ask how they got there or whether they deserve our help.

2109
02:15:47.294 --> 02:15:50.994
We ask whether they're breathing, whether we can protect their

2110
02:15:51.074 --> 02:15:54.974
airway, and whether we can reverse what is happening, because that

2111
