2125
02:16:46.755 --> 02:16:50.575
delays treatment, and ultimately delays the most important

2126
02:16:50.654 --> 02:16:52.934
intervention of all, calling for help.

2127
02:16:53.675 --> 02:16:57.434
In overdose medicine, the quality and speed of the information we

2128
