antidotes we use, and ultimately the patient's outcome.

2130
02:17:05.734 --> 02:17:09.454
The healthcare system works best when people trust that they can seek

2131
02:17:09.514 --> 02:17:12.995
help without fear. This bill helps build that trust.

2132
02:17:13.804 --> 02:17:16.614
The bill recognizes the reality of these emergencies.

2133
02:17:17.034 --> 02:17:20.575
Its protections extend not only to the person making the call,

2134
02:17:21.075 --> 02:17:24.534
