2135
02:17:24.594 --> 02:17:27.495
reaction, and to others who remain at the scene.

2136
02:17:28.354 --> 02:17:31.134
Most of these overdoses do not happen in hospitals.

2137
02:17:31.675 --> 02:17:35.474
They happen in homes, among friends, between partners, and

2138
02:17:35.495 --> 02:17:39.294
