2139
02:17:39.554 --> 02:17:43.075
111, remain with the person in distress, provide

2140
02:17:43.214 --> 02:17:46.374
accurate information, and assist emergency services.

2141
02:17:47.274 --> 02:17:50.714
No one should have to choose between helping someone they care about

2142
