2234
02:23:28.046 --> 02:23:31.956
None of which would have occurred had his condition been recognized as

2235
02:23:32.046 --> 02:23:34.726
a mental illness and there was early and appropriate

2236
02:23:34.786 --> 02:23:36.936
intervention to assist him.

2237
02:23:37.886 --> 02:23:41.686
I plotted my son's offending over 20 years against his

2238
02:23:41.706 --> 02:23:44.406
drug use, and the correlation is striking.

2239
02:23:45.766 --> 02:23:49.726
His offending rose during active addiction, ceased completely

2240
02:23:49.736 --> 02:23:52.626
during recovery, and reemerged only with relapse.

2241
02:23:53.266 --> 02:23:56.306
This pattern was not evidence of a criminal disposition.

2242
02:23:56.386 --> 02:24:00.126
It showed that crime follows drug abuse and addiction.

2243
02:24:00.226 --> 02:24:02.086
It does not precede it.

2244
02:24:04.346 --> 02:24:07.846
To reduce drug-related harm, including crime, we need

2245
02:24:07.926 --> 02:24:09.306
to treat

2246
02:24:10.226 --> 02:24:13.026
SUD as a serious health condition

2247
02:24:13.886 --> 02:24:17.726
and invest in care for people rather than fruitless and expensive arrests

2248
